This repository (`viavitae-control`) is the infrastructure control plane for the
Via-Vitae organization and may contain organization structure, security policy,
and compliance configuration. It is NOT licensed for redistribution.

1. Permitted use. Authorized members of Via-Vitae may read, run, and modify this
   repository solely to operate and secure the organization's infrastructure, in
   accordance with the change-control process defined herein.

2. Restrictions. No part of this repository may be copied, distributed, published,
   sublicensed, or used to build a derivative control plane for any other
   organization without prior written authorization from the project owner.

3. Confidentiality. Configuration, outputs, and any state produced by this
   repository are treated as confidential under the organization's information
   security policy (ISO 27001 A.8 / SOC 2 CC6) and GDPR Art. 32.

4. No warranty. Provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. Operating this
   control plane against a live organization is done at the operator's own risk;
   always review `terraform plan` before `terraform apply`.

For licensing questions contact the Via-Vitae security team.
